		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνειρύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>draw together</i>, in aor.
			
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁκόταν . . συνειρυσθῇ ὑπὸ τοῦ
					ῥίγεος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					1.26
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			
				Pass.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνείρ&lt;υ&gt;ται:
			συνέσπασται</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph. in 
				Act.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίς σε δαιμόνων κακῇ ἀθυμίῃ
				ξυνείρυσεν</span>; Epigr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				2.112
			</span></i>.</div>
